---
import LogoMark from './LogoMark.astro';
---

<section>
  <svg
    class="arches"
    viewBox="0 0 1400 500"
    preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice"
    fill="none"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <g transform="translate(-100 60) scale(9)">
      <path
        d="M8 12 v16 a8 8 0 0 0 16 0 v-16 M24 12 v16 a8 8 0 0 0 16 0 v-16 M40 28 v6 a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2 h-6"
        stroke="var(--teal-soft)"
        stroke-width="6.5"
        stroke-linecap="round"></path>
      <circle cx="32" cy="19" r="3.5" fill="var(--gold)" class="pulse-dot"></circle>
    </g>
    <path
      d="M1120 200 v130 a90 90 0 0 0 180 0 v-130"
      stroke="var(--teal-deep)"
      stroke-width="48"
      stroke-linecap="round"></path>
  </svg>

  <div class="inner">
    <LogoMark size={44} color="var(--bg)" />
    <h2>Tu edificio ya trabaja 24/7. Dale un sistema que también lo haga.</h2>
    <p>
      Demo de 30 minutos, con tus propios casos: la visita conflictiva, la parrilla del sábado,
      la mudanza sorpresa.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <button type="button" class="primary">Solicitar demo</button>
      <button type="button" class="secondary">Escribir a hola@wasiy.pe</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  section {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--teal);
    padding: 110px 48px;
  }

  .arches {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .pulse-dot {
    animation: wa-pulse 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .inner {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 26px;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font: 700 46px/1.1 var(--font-sora);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--bg);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0;
    font: 400 17px/1.6 var(--font-instrument);
    color: var(--teal-pale);
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .primary {
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--ink);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px 30px;
    font: 600 16px var(--font-instrument);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .primary:hover {
    background: var(--gold-light);
  }

  .secondary {
    border: 1.5px solid var(--teal-mid);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--bg);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px 26px;
    font: 600 15px var(--font-instrument);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .secondary:hover {
    background: var(--teal-dark);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    section {
      padding: 64px 20px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
